{"before_validation in EmbeddableHost model uses sub! on host without nil check, which will raise NoMethodError if host is nil instead of returning a clean validation error": 0.9133610129356384, "Admin controller update and destroy actions fetch host record but do not check for nil before calling methods, causing NoMethodError and 500 errors when invalid id is supplied": 0.8592656254768372, "Change to embedded _id(s) hydration in store.js modifies core store hydration behavior, changing how embedded arrays (_ids) are turned into object references, always setting an array (possibly empty) at the pluralized property and deleting the raw _ids key, which has broad impact on any API using __rest_serializer format": 0.47906768321990967, "Admin embedding saveChanges calls update but server-side Admin::EmbeddingController#update is a no-op that ignores incoming parameters and does not persist any changes, making Save Changes appear to succeed but changes are not kept across reloads": 0.4469276964664459, "SQL injection risk in migration when inserting hosts - host string is inserted directly into SQL statement using string interpolation without escaping or parameterization": 0.9299930334091187, "ADMIN_MODELS basePath logic change applies underscore-to-dash normalization generically, which could accidentally classify other models as admin models if naming overlaps, potentially routing AJAX calls to wrong controllers": 0.1990593671798706, "Removing fallback to SiteSetting.embed_category can lead to nil category when creating embedded topics if no matching EmbeddableHost exists, potentially causing post/topic creation to fail": 0.8591296672821045, "EmbeddableHostSerializer returns only category_id but Ember UI expects host.category to be an associated Category model object, causing host.category to be nil and breaking UI rendering": 0.8441272377967834}